cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this pipeline, please cite both the manuscript and the Zenodo DOI of the release you used."
title: "vitek2-n442-ast-validation: R pipeline for evaluation of the VITEK 2 AST-N442 card against reference MIC methods"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gravey
    given-names: Francois
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8672-8286"
    affiliation: CHU de Caen Normandie; UNICAEN/UNIROUEN INSERM, DYNAMICURE UMR-S 1311
  - family-names: Bouland
    given-names: Guillaume
    affiliation: CHU de Caen Normandie
repository-code: "https://github.com/fgravey/vitek2-n442-ast-validation"
abstract: "R analysis pipeline used in 'Performance of the VITEK AST-N442 Card for Susceptibility Testing of Hospital-Acquired Enterobacterales' (Microbiology Spectrum). Computes Essential Agreement, bias, Categorical Agreement, VME/ME/miE error rates (ISO 20776-1/2, CLSI M52), McNemar tests, and exploratory Fisher exact subgroup analyses, and generates manuscript figures and supplementary tables."
keywords:
  - antimicrobial susceptibility testing
  - VITEK 2
  - AST-N442
  - Enterobacterales
  - ISO 20776
  - EUCAST
  - very major error
license: MIT
